 {
  "id": "perceive",
  "n": "07",
  "title": "The same grammar, from footage",
  "say": "Point that grammar at real video and the shape stays the same. A tracker, a depth model, an aligner: each one measures something and writes a fact. But a measurement can be wrong, so every perceived fact carries its producer and its confidence. A fact with no source is exact. That one rule tells a reader which kind it is holding.",
